<div class="eyebrow">Admin</div>
<h1 class="mb-3">Manage</h1>
{{> admin-tabs}}

<p class="text-muted">
  Check that each Supplier is a legit company. <strong>Approve</strong> gives the Verified badge; an ISO certificate helps,
  but is not required. <strong>Reject</strong> (with a reason) hides all their products from buyers and stops them from
  adding or editing products.
</p>

<div class="search-box mb-3">
  {{> search-icon}}
  <input id="supplier-search" type="search" name="q" maxlength="100" class="form-control" placeholder="Search by company or certificate..."
         hx-get="/admin/suppliers/results" hx-trigger="input changed delay:300ms, search"
         hx-target="#supplier-results" hx-swap="outerHTML" hx-include="#supplier-filter">
</div>

{{> admin-supplier-results}}
